WEBVTT

1
00:00:01,780 --> 00:00:05,250
Brother Wang Yi

2
00:00:05,250 --> 00:00:06,985
Afraid

3
00:00:06,985 --> 00:00:15,660
Can you come over and save Qin'er?

4
00:00:15,660 --> 00:00:24,335
Qin'er must be obedient after he passes there

5
00:00:24,335 --> 00:00:36,480
Whatever you ask Qin'er to do, Qin'er will do it.

6
00:00:41,610 --> 00:00:42,065
Qin'er

7
00:00:42,065 --> 00:00:44,795
My brother is also heartbroken when you look like this.

8
00:00:44,795 --> 00:00:46,387
But I can't go out

9
00:00:46,387 --> 00:00:48,207
Chen Zhenghao is next door to me

10
00:00:48,207 --> 00:00:49,800
Otherwise, come here
